WEBVTT

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:37.990
I've been expecting your call.

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:41.410
Yes, there's no need to worry.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:44.710
I have them standing by.

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:49.630
Consider it done.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:25.020
FIERCE

00:02:26.810 --> 00:02:28.020
Time to work.

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:45.300
I have a feeling
it's going to be a long night.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:37.750
Wait.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:43.670
It'll only activate for residents.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:45.470
<i>Can you do something?</i>

00:05:46.170 --> 00:05:48.220
<i>Just ask for a key from the front desk.</i>

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:58.350
<i>Looks like they're gone.</i>

00:05:58.940 --> 00:05:59.770
Yeah.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:09.990
Made it.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:27.510
This is everything...?

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.010
Yes.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.600
Masks...

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.610
I'd like to discuss...

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:44.690
our next move.

00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:26.960
Hey!

00:08:37.850 --> 00:08:38.680
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:08:51.030 --> 00:08:53.030
<i>Hey, no more shooting doors open!</i>

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:03.580
I'll try the front desk again.

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:07.920
Hey, James--

00:09:14.760 --> 00:09:15.930
Hello?

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:23.930
I'd like to ask you to come in at the end.

00:09:33.740 --> 00:09:35.200
The LIVE Corporation.

00:09:48.630 --> 00:09:50.840
-Eddy?
-Yeah.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:53.170
I'm the one who called you earlier.

00:10:08.310 --> 00:10:09.230
What's going on?

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:35.630
Anna?

00:10:36.670 --> 00:10:39.090
Yes. Anna Winehouse.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.720
The current president of Ecohes.

00:10:42.930 --> 00:10:43.760
Ecohes?

00:10:44.640 --> 00:10:46.850
James followed the clues
from Fred's house,

00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.430
and they led him to her.

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:53.310
It seems they both started off
at the same lab.

00:10:55.070 --> 00:10:55.900
Anna?

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.110
Anna Winehouse.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.410
I'll send you a quick summary.

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:05.910
Wait a second...

00:11:09.460 --> 00:11:10.290
Hey.

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.090
What's gotten into you?

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:20.090
Hey.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:22.260
Calm down!

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:30.940
Hey.

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:34.110
Come on.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:45.910
Will you cut it out?

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:17.190
Hello? What is it, Sarah?

00:12:17.270 --> 00:12:18.520
<i>-Sarah</i>.
-Hold on!

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.460
That's right.

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:42.720
Monica was in charge...

00:12:43.380 --> 00:12:45.550
of a case involving Ecohes not long ago.

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:52.730
It's Sarah.

00:12:58.770 --> 00:12:59.860
Ecohes.

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:07.700
<i>I remember.</i>

00:13:09.280 --> 00:13:10.120
One time,

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:13.450
Monica mentioned she was invited
to Ecohes for a function.

00:13:15.870 --> 00:13:18.290
What? Then does that mean...?

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:21.170
The link between Fred and Monica.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:26.720
Fred and Anna once worked at the same lab.

00:13:28.720 --> 00:13:30.850
And they're still friends.

00:13:32.350 --> 00:13:34.560
Monica met Fred at this function.

00:13:35.940 --> 00:13:37.730
Through Anna.

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:40.060
And Fred...

00:13:40.570 --> 00:13:42.780
reached out to Monica.

00:14:23.070 --> 00:14:23.940
If...

00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:27.700
the two of them never met...

00:14:29.490 --> 00:14:30.320
Sarah.

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.160
<i>I know.</i>

00:14:34.990 --> 00:14:35.830
I know.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:39.420
I'm okay.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:06.610
<i>I'm sorry, I will call you back later.</i>

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:09.780
Please let me know if you learn anything
about Fred.

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:13.370
Sarah!

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:26.090
James!

00:16:10.920 --> 00:16:11.920
Eddy!

00:16:12.720 --> 00:16:13.840
Switch over my contacts!

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.180
Okay, switching modes!

00:16:18.930 --> 00:16:19.770
Thanks.

00:16:44.120 --> 00:16:45.170
Damn it.

00:17:26.580 --> 00:17:28.330
I'm over here.

00:17:35.300 --> 00:17:36.340
Eddy.

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:38.340
I'm heading over there.

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:41.430
Okay, I'll arrange for backup.

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.140
What a mess.

00:17:58.700 --> 00:18:00.910
Well, it's part of the job.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:07.790
Who is he?

00:18:08.330 --> 00:18:09.210
The SSC.

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.590
They'll likely take Fred into custody.

00:18:19.930 --> 00:18:23.310
I don't care where he ends up
as long as he's safe.

00:18:24.770 --> 00:18:28.350
I always had a soft spot
when it comes to my brother.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:45.330
I rather liked this laboratory.

00:18:56.090 --> 00:18:58.970
Would you indulge me?

00:19:07.680 --> 00:19:12.270
There's something I need to get
before we leave here.

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:06.370
Let me show you something.

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:12.120
What is that?

00:20:46.910 --> 00:20:50.750
<i>Could you explain how your military</i>
<i>projects and humanitarian efforts coexist?</i>

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:56.630
<i>Because they are both</i>
<i>founded on technology.</i>

00:20:57.590 --> 00:21:00.710
<i>Could you comment on the allegations</i>
<i>against you?</i>

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:02.470
<i>Wait!</i>

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:04.930
<i>Please--</i>

00:21:34.910 --> 00:21:36.420
Don't miss the next one.

00:21:39.540 --> 00:21:42.670
I've secured the intruders.

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:47.680
We can look into them later.

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:52.060
<i>I found Fred.</i>

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.180
Fred?

00:21:55.640 --> 00:21:56.480
Yes.

00:21:57.020 --> 00:22:00.400
<i>He's unconscious,</i>
<i>but it's nothing serious.</i>

00:22:04.280 --> 00:22:05.820
<i>I'll be there soon.</i>

00:22:06.570 --> 00:22:07.400
<i>Understood.</i>

00:22:15.870 --> 00:22:16.830
Jeez.

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:20.080
Time for a nap, huh?

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:23.960
Well, I'm glad your owner's safe now.

00:24:19.450 --> 00:24:21.960
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
